  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 1.0.0 adds separate generic typed-state and non-generic value-bag command builders. Command values remain ID-keyed and share the existing parser, validation, permissions, manager execution, history, and help workflows. The generic builder carries TState once; the non-generic builder supports commands without a dedicated state DTO. The package remains backed internally by Workes.ContentSystem and exposes no ContentSystem types publicly. This release has source-breaking command registration changes from pre-1.0 versions; see the migration guide.",
